# Forum Familiar: the trigger's one target is checked again as it resolves (CR 608.2b), and an ability whose targets are all illegal does nothing, the counter included.
# Bot1 turns the Familiar up on turn 3 for a Mox Pearl and a Mox Jet and aims at its Memnite; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 kills the Memnite with a Lightning Bolt.
# The Memnite is in the graveyard, not returned to hand, and the Familiar stays a 1/1 with no counter.

